          "document_start": 290,
          "document_end": 390,
          "text": "特别要指出的是：键合空间和通常的三维真实空间是不一样的，键合空间要求其中流矢量和势矢量所有元素的因果关系具有一致性，而在三维真实空间中运动的物体，其各个运动坐标及其所受的力则没有这种严格的一致性要求；",
          "section_id": "section_163713fff149",
          "start": 290,
          "end": 390,
          "chunk_start": 290,
          "chunk_end": 390,
          "sentence_document_start": 290,
          "sentence_document_end": 390,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_f3c5e8559267e9c33cfa",
          "document_start": 390,
          "document_end": 641,
          "text": "同时还要注意，在考虑键合空间中各矢量对时间的变化关系时，要把表示矢量的坐标值和键合空间的基同时考虑，所以尽管在后面许多地方我们所应用的键合空间的维数是一维，但这时的四种广义变量也不能单纯地看成标量，而是一个包含一维基和一个坐标值的乘积的量，对现实空间中运动的物体来讲，这个基往往是某个惯性空间的线性组合，如果这个基相对于惯性空间不变或变化可以不计，则四种广义变量的考虑和一般键合图理论中的标量考虑法是相同的，但如果基相对于惯性空间有变化且这种变化对系统来讲不能忽略，这时就必须同时考虑坐标值和基的变化。",
          "section_id": "section_163713fff149",
          "start": 390,
          "end": 641,
          "chunk_start": 390,
          "chunk_end": 641,
          "sentence_document_start": 390,
          "sentence_document_end": 641,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_9cae5897eba629973f07",
          "document_start": 641,
          "document_end": 666,
          "text": "这也是键合空间和一般标量系统键合图理论的最大差别。",
          "section_id": "section_163713fff149",
          "start": 641,
          "end": 666,
          "chunk_start": 641,
          "chunk_end": 666,
          "sentence_document_start": 641,
          "sentence_document_end": 666,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_451735ea89c755c6e7f2",
          "document_start": 666,
          "document_end": 685,
          "text": "据以上这些因素定义键合空间的键的符号为",
          "section_id": "section_163713fff149",
          "start": 666,
          "end": 685,
          "chunk_start": 666,
          "chunk_end": 685,
          "sentence_document_start": 666,
          "sentence_document_end": 685,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_87a307f0d2db54442fa5",
          "document_start": 687,
          "document_end": 707,
          "text": "[Source paragraph 2;",
          "section_id": "section_163713fff149",
          "start": 687,
          "end": 707,
          "chunk_start": 687,
          "chunk_end": 707,
          "sentence_document_start": 687,
          "sentence_document_end": 707,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_8623d0849251e8f97cd8",
          "document_start": 708,
          "document_end": 725,
          "text": "# 二、键合空间、键和通口的定义;",
          "section_id": "section_163713fff149",
          "start": 708,
          "end": 725,
          "chunk_start": 708,
          "chunk_end": 725,
          "sentence_document_start": 708,
          "sentence_document_end": 725,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_0e8356302c676956db9c",
          "document_start": 726,
          "document_end": 758,
          "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
          "section_id": "section_163713fff149",
          "start": 726,
          "end": 758,
          "chunk_start": 726,
          "chunk_end": 758,
          "sentence_document_start": 726,
          "sentence_document_end": 758,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_55ce82236b3f48202c93",
          "document_start": 760,
          "document_end": 858,
          "text": "用图形符号“|→，→”表示，其中：箭体的线段代表键合空间，箭头表示功率的流向，用与箭体垂直的短线表示因果关系，当短线和箭头异侧时，表示功率流动的主因为流，当短线和箭头同侧时表示功率流动的主因为势。",
          "section_id": "section_163713fff149",
          "start": 760,
          "end": 858,
          "chunk_start": 760,
          "chunk_end": 858,
          "sentence_document_start": 760,
          "sentence_document_end": 858,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_2cd9cbc345e9ca15e729",
          "document_start": 860,
          "document_end": 880,
          "text": "[Source paragraph 3;",
          "section_id": "section_163713fff149",
          "start": 860,
          "end": 880,
          "chunk_start": 860,
          "chunk_end": 880,
          "sentence_document_start": 860,
          "sentence_document_end": 880,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_2bacbb30369b8956496a",
          "document_start": 881,
          "document_end": 898,
          "text": "# 二、键合空间、键和通口的定义;",
          "section_id": "section_163713fff149",
          "start": 881,
          "end": 898,
          "chunk_start": 881,
          "chunk_end": 898,
          "sentence_document_start": 881,
          "sentence_document_end": 898,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_a1d6eae756fcd7d89f74",
          "document_start": 899,
          "document_end": 931,
          "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
          "section_id": "section_163713fff149",
          "start": 899,
          "end": 931,
          "chunk_start": 899,
          "chunk_end": 931,
          "sentence_document_start": 899,
          "sentence_document_end": 931,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_e1d1826010c4fb76151c",
          "document_start": 933,
          "document_end": 993,
          "text": "定义：在系统中系统与外部，系统内各子系统之间、各元件之间能够相互连接使功率流动的地方就叫通口，每一通口可用一根键来表示。",
          "section_id": "section_163713fff149",
          "start": 933,
          "end": 993,
          "chunk_start": 933,
          "chunk_end": 993,
          "sentence_document_start": 933,
          "sentence_document_end": 993,
          "sentence_complete": true
        }
